09:25.840 --> 09:26.960
Quarta mistura!

09:27.390 --> 09:28.030
Wenqian,

09:28.720 --> 09:29.510
coloque o fuligem.

09:41.200 --> 09:42.480
Sr. Jinshui, deixe comigo.

09:42.630 --> 09:43.360
Vovô,

09:43.720 --> 09:44.960
